@api = http://localhost:5000

### Health check -> 200
GET {{api}}/

### Liet ke bai tap -> 200
GET {{api}}/api/assignments

### Bai tap ton tai -> 200
GET {{api}}/api/assignments/1

### Bai tap khong ton tai -> 404 ASSIGNMENT_NOT_FOUND
GET {{api}}/api/assignments/999

### Tao luot nop -> 201 Created + Location
# @name createSubmission
POST {{api}}/api/assignments/1/submissions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "studentCode": "SV001",
  "repositoryUrl": "https://example.com/sv001/rest-api"
}

### Doc lai luot nop vua tao -> 200
GET {{api}}/api/submissions/{{createSubmission.response.body.$.id}}

### Body khong hop le -> 400 INVALID_SUBMISSION
POST {{api}}/api/assignments/1/submissions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "studentCode": "",
  "repositoryUrl": ""
}

### Bai tap da dong -> 400 ASSIGNMENT_CLOSED
POST {{api}}/api/assignments/3/submissions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "studentCode": "SV001",
  "repositoryUrl": "https://example.com/sv001/rest-api"
}

### Bai tap khong ton tai -> 404 ASSIGNMENT_NOT_FOUND
POST {{api}}/api/assignments/999/submissions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "studentCode": "SV001",
  "repositoryUrl": "https://example.com/sv001/rest-api"
}
